  pre-fix blob swapped in via snapshot: exit 1, 6 failures across both suites
    - drill conflicts: refuses resolution without a backup
    - drill conflicts: remote-only edit and remote-only addition survive merge
    - gate passes with every canonical check decided by a real drill
      (State.pass expected, State.fail actual)
    - report serialisation: SYNC_BACKUP_CONFLICT_VALIDATED_LOCAL expected,
      SYNC_BACKUP_CONFLICT_INCONSISTENT actual
    - plus the 2 focused regression tests
